{"term": "прыгнуть в постель", "lang": "ru", "script": "cyrl", "romanization": "prygnut' v postel'", "category": "euphemisms_idioms", "subcategory": "casual_sex", "concept": "hookup", "is_novel_concept": false, "register": "euphemism", "crude": 18, "technical": 2, "recognition_pct_current": 90, "recognition_pct_peak": 90, "peak_year": null, "regional": null, "definition": "To jump into bed with someone; a Russian idiom for having a hasty or casual sexual encounter, emphasizing impulsiveness or eagerness.", "english_term": "to jump into bed with someone", "english_translation_quality": "direct", "notes": "The perfective 'прыгнуть' (to jump once) adds a sense of quickness or rashness; often used critically to describe ill-considered sexual decisions or reckless romantic behavior."}
